From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QinCai-rui <git@qincai.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mmc: sunxi: accept nonnegative vqmmc voltage results

mmc_regulator_set_vqmmc() can return a positive value when the
voltage already satisfies the request. Treat only negative values as
errors and preserve their original error codes.

---
diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
@@ -985,8 +985,8 @@
 	/* vqmmc regulator is available */
 	if (!IS_ERR(mmc->supply.vqmmc)) {
 		ret = mmc_regulator_set_vqmmc(mmc, ios);
-		if (ret)
-			return -EIO;
+		if (ret < 0)
+			return ret;
 	}
 
 	switch (ios->signal_voltage) {
